  {"date": "2024-07-27", "venue": "Alpine Valley Music Theatre", "city": "East Troy", "state": "WI", "gap": 8, "set": "2", "out": "->", "next": "Simple", "xprev": "David Bowie", "nb": 1},
  {"date": "2024-08-06", "venue": "Van Andel Arena", "city": "Grand Rapids", "state": "MI", "gap": 7, "set": "1", "jamchart": true, "jam": "Less by way of bells and whistles than vim and vigor, play is fierce. Trey seemingly signals for a shift after the five-minute mark; Page, however, blows through the stop sign, igniting an exciting audible - one which underscores what makes \"basic\" Phish c. 2024 (hint: Trey, here) so very peak.", "prev": "Strawberry Letter 23", "in": ">", "next": "Peaches en Regalia", "nb": 1},
  {"date": "2024-08-11", "venue": "Bethel Woods Center for the Arts", "city": "Bethel", "state": "NY", "gap": 4, "set": "1", "prev": "Axilla", "in": ">", "xnext": "Buried Alive", "nb": 1},
  {"date": "2024-08-18", "venue": "The Woodlands", "city": "Dover", "state": "DE", "gap": 4, "set": "1", "out": "->", "prev": "AC/DC Bag", "next": "Rift", "nb": 1},
  {"date": "2024-08-29", "venue": "Dick's Sporting Goods Park", "city": "Commerce City", "state": "CO", "gap": 1, "set": "2", "jamchart": true, "jam": "Pretty version, ft. pronounced echoes through Trey's vocal section. Some of those strong \"TFTB\" vibes as play coasts. Trey augments his tone - also pretty - and the band works through a light, airy jam, with particularly notable play from Fish. Trey alights upon yet another great theme (he makes it seem so easy these days) which, owing to his patience, allows for a restrained, yet thoughtful, conclusion. Quiet highlight.", "prev": "A Wave of Hope", "in": ">", "next": "Pillow Jets", "nb": 1},
  {"date": "2024-10-26", "venue": "MVP Arena", "city": "Albany", "state": "NY", "gap": 5, "set": "1", "out": ">", "prev": "Possum", "next": "Back on the Train", "nb": 1},
  {"date": "2024-12-31", "venue": "Madison Square Garden", "city": "New York", "state": "NY", "gap": 5, "set": "2", "out": ">", "next": "My Friend, My Friend", "xprev": "The Squirming Coil", "nb": 1},
  {"date": "2025-01-31", "venue": "Moon Palace", "city": "Cancun", "state": "Quintana Roo", "gap": 3, "set": "1", "prev": "The Moma Dance", "next": "Tube", "nb": 1},
  {"date": "2025-04-20", "venue": "Moda Center", "city": "Portland", "state": "OR", "gap": 4, "set": "1", "jamchart": true, "jam": "Heats up quickly with a suspenseful minor jam out of the gates before sprinkling in some major at 9:40 and then fully shifts at 11:00 for a brief bliss-out. The next few minutes are transitional (though Mike is getting busy), but soon enough the jam roars back to life as the energy builds and builds to a blistering peak and then smoothly return to the final refrain.", "prev": "Bouncing Around the Room", "next": "Run Like an Antelope", "nb": 1},
  {"date": "2025-07-05", "venue": "Folsom Field", "city": "Boulder", "state": "CO", "gap": 14, "set": "1", "jamchart": true, "jam": "Gets to \"that place\" in a hurry as it sails through the stratosphere on a wave of synths and full-sustain guitar to touch the divine.", "prev": "Birds of a Feather", "next": "David Bowie", "nb": 1},
  {"date": "2025-07-22", "venue": "Forest Hills Stadium", "city": "Forest Hills", "state": "NY", "gap": 10, "set": "1", "out": ">", "prev": "Rift", "next": "Possum", "nb": 1},
  {"date": "2025-09-13", "venue": "Coca-Cola Amphitheater", "city": "Birmingham", "state": "AL", "gap": 6, "set": "2", "jamchart": true, "jam": "In the most exploratory version since Dick's 2024,  \"Sigma\" kicks off a fluid second set segment of thematic jamming. Interwoven melodies from Page and Trey float above 8-armed magnetic drumming from Fish, where synths meet bright chords in weightless jamming that eventually rises around 14:20 into ethereal space. Building towards a thrilling peak from Trey, filled with unique riffing, the jamming bobs and weaves while staying rooted in Page's regal baby grand. One of those jams where every time you think they're finished they seem to find a new idea before they latch onto a sustained build -> into \"DWD.\"", "out": ">", "next": "Down with Disease", "xprev": "Runaway Jim", "nb": 1},
  {"date": "2025-12-28", "venue": "Madison Square Garden", "city": "New York", "state": "NY", "gap": 7, "set": "1", "out": ">", "prev": "Punch You in the Eye", "in": ">", "next": "Taste", "nb": 1},
  {"date": "2026-01-28", "venue": "Moon Palace", "city": "Cancun", "state": "Quintana Roo", "gap": 4, "set": "1", "prev": "Breath and Burning", "next": "Fling Your Head", "nb": 1},
  {"date": "2026-04-18", "venue": "Sphere", "city": "Las Vegas", "state": "NV", "gap": 6, "set": "1", "jamchart": true, "jam": "Here the jam almost stalls before it begins, but instead churns in a murky space, finding some direction behind Page\u2019s lovely Rhodes work which acts as prelude to both Mike and Trey asserting themselves. Fish\u2019s rhythmic diversity pushes the improv further and everyone contributes to an intensifying stew that spreads out as a broadening plateau before leading to the eventual return.", "prev": "Fly Famous Mockingbird", "next": "Walk Away", "nb": 1},
